/*
 * CHR_DATA_B.C  the fix-layer font (sc_chr_data) and the screen and message cells read by EFF67.c, effa6_mes.c,
 * effb8_mes.c, efff9_mes.c, game_config_jp.c, sc_trans.c, se_2.c and scrn_data.c
 *
 * Linked at the end of the tables; the test menu screens, at the start, are chr_data.c.
 * The message records and their conn and chr lists are written by tools/messages2i.py. The cells from
 * sc_chr_data to config_jp_chr_f400 are one bank: the code reaches most of them through sc_chr_data by cell
 * number (32 bytes a cell), so sc_blank_chr and wipe_mask_chr run on to the next object a reader names.
 */

